 "title": "Density needed for induction on the affine cover",
 "statement": "For $r>1$, the overlap $X_{r-1}\\cap U_r$ is dense in $X_r$.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-thm-nagata-sketch-noetherian/lemma-nagata-partial-union-overlap-dense.md",
